OL,3,GNEWSAHistoric Dunoon venue facing      
OL,4,Aclosure due to soaring running costs   
OL,6,FA historic arts and events centre in   
OL,7,FDunoon that has been part of the area  
OL,8,Ffor over 150 years is set to close by  
OL,9,Fthe end of the year.                   
OL,11,FThe board of trustees at Dunoon Burgh  
OL,12,FHall said the venue will shut on 20    
OL,13,FDecember, unless an emergency funding  
OL,14,Fpackage can be secured.                
OL,16,FIt said the decision came after a      
OL,17,Fperiod of financial pressure, with the 
OL,18,Flisted building facing "spiralling     
OL,19,Frunning costs" and increased pressure  
OL,20,Fon available funding sources.          
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
